ssets/media/demos/recording-video2game-garden.webp","aspectRatio",1.507462686567164,"mobile","previewSrc","Preview description","Official Video2Game browser recording showing a block character in a reconstructed garden, a vase on a table, control instructions and score","alt","Recording type","Original project recording","role","provenance","Track","3D","track","metadata","Related project",[92],"resourceId",{"_50":93,"_26":94},"Video2Game","/resources/video2game/","What this recording shows","A recorded research demo of a reconstructed scene with added rigid-body interactions. It does not demonstrate that arbitrary input videos become complete games without additional reconstruction, collider setup and gameplay integration.","limitations","Engine / renderer","Three.js · WebGL","engine","Demo category","Scene generation","demoType","lead","3d","scenes","source-recording","recordingId","video2game","resource:video2game","resource","Reconstructs real-world video into interactive 3D environments for the browser.","/resources/",{"_20":109,"_185":93,"_183":105,"_48":186,"_184":112,"_179":178,"_26":176,"_58":187,"_160":188,"_154":189,"_151":190,"_145":191,"_142":141},[117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124,125,126,127,128,129,130],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_48":22,"_52":93,"_54":185,"_56":-7},{"_48":104,"_52":112,"_54":184,"_56":-7},{"_48":49,"_50":181,"_52":182,"_54":183,"_56":88},{"_48":49,"_50":180,"_52":171,"_54":48,"_56":88},{"_48":49,"_50":177,"_52":178,"_54":179,"_56":57},{"_48":58,"_50":173,"_60":174,"_54":26,"_56":-7},{"_48":58,"_50":165,"_60":166,"_54":58,"_56":-7},{"_48":146,"_50":158,"_148":149,"_60":159,"_54":160,"_56":-7},{"_48":146,"_50":152,"_148":149,"_60":153,"_54":154,"_56":-7},{"_48":146,"_50":147,"_148":149,"_60":150,"_54":151,"_56":-7},{"_48":49,"_50":143,"_52":144,"_54":145,"_56":88},{"_48":49,"_50":140,"_52":141,"_54":142,"_56":88},{"_48":49,"_54":137,"_50":138,"_52":139},{"_48":58,"_54":131,"_50":132,"_60":133},"identitySource","Identity evidence",[134],{"_50":135,"_26":136},"University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign","https://arxiv.org/html/2404.09833","identity","Identity & attribution","The paper lists first author Hongchi Xia at both UIUC and Shanghai Jiao Tong University, with coauthors at UIUC and Cornell. UIUC is one verified first-author affiliation. This is its official brand CDN icon, linked by illinois.edu.","Source reviewed","2026-10-19","verified","Year","2024","year","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[86],"dimensions","Development stages",[155,156,157],"stages","Assets & animation","Engines & scenes","World models","Topics",[161,162,163,164],"tags","Video-to-3D","Reconstruction","Three.js","Collision","Further reading",[167,168],{"_50":171,"_26":172},{"_50":169,"_26":170},"Pinned engine-handoff recommendations","https://github.com/video2game/video2game/blob/7bcf8ae754240b9fd2de75a154eb73c75a146b79/readme.md#L256-L273","Paper","https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.09833","Project source",[175],{"_50":173,"_26":176},"https://github.com/video2game/video2game","Why it belongs here","Video and camera information pass through reconstruction, mesh extraction, appearance baking, and collision generation into a three.js game environment. The documented UE route recommends fully diffuse baked meshes, with the baking specular dimension set to zero. This is an explicit environment reconstruction approach with remaining manual scene setup and physics integration. It should be distinguished from interactive video world models that predict the next frame.","detail","Resource type","Category","3D development","category","summary","name","paper",[195,196],[161,162,163,164],[192,193,194],[105],2024,"assets","scene","world",{"_50":171,"_26":172},{"_50":169,"_26":170},{"_198":199},"documents",{"_200":201,"_202":203},"en",[205,209,210,211,208,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,207,244,206,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262],"zh",[204,205,206,207,208],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","skills/level-design/references/case-studies","skills/level-design/references/combat-balance","skills/level-design/references/culture-history","skills/level-design/references/foundations","skills/level-design/references/learning","skills/level-design/references/lighting-art","skills/level-design/references/optimization-release","skills/level-design/references/scripting-doors","skills/level-design/references/source-map","skills/level-design/references/spatial-layout","skills/level-design/references/tools-quake","skills/level-design/references/wayfinding-playtesting","skills/level-design/templates/level-brief","skills/level-design/templates/playtest-report","skills/level-design/templates/review"]
